# --- Auto-generated docs (regen via `make` / scripts — NUNCA commitear) ---
# Cement 2026-05-20 — Chris ratificó "gitignore total" para evitar merge conflicts
# crónicos en archivos derivados. SSoT vive en las sources; estos son views.
#
# Regenerar: .venv/bin/python scripts/generate_backlog.py --brand vitalia
# Ver `.claude/rules/sistema-docs-schema.md` R3.

# BACKLOG auto-gen (per-brand + platform root)
*/docs/product/BACKLOG.md
*/docs/product/BACKLOG.yaml
*/docs/product/BACKLOG-TLDR.md
docs/product/BACKLOG.md
docs/product/BACKLOG.yaml
docs/product/BACKLOG-TLDR.md

# areas/ user-facing (auto-gen scripts/generate_capability_index.py · 1 file por agent_owner)
*/docs/product/areas/*.md

# Screenshots ad-hoc de verificación manual (no baselines Playwright)
vitalia/frontend/_shots/

# Frontend generated code (offer-field-paths + futuros __generated__)
**/__generated__/

# Story refs (chris-input.md binarios · v2 cement 2026-05-27)
# Mantenemos chris-input.md tracked (cita paths) pero binarios uploaded vía /api/refs/upload no inflan repo.
# Si Chris necesita compartir refs cross-machine → mover a {brand}/docs/product/stories/{id}/refs-shared/ (tracked manual opt-in).
**/docs/product/stories/**/refs/*
!**/docs/product/stories/**/refs/*.md
!**/docs/product/stories/**/refs/.gitkeep

# Phase execution log (autonomous /goal runs · ephemeral)
.phase-execution-log.md

# Cockpit (binario alpaca · pidfile/log del daemon per-worktree)
.cockpit/


